// =============================================================================
// 06: LIVE DJ SET — 3-TRACK ALGORAVE PERFORMANCE
// =============================================================================
//
// 🎛️ PERFORMANCE CONTROLS (<leader> = Space):
//   <leader>ml : :StrudelLaunch (Launch browser / sync buffer)
//   <leader>mp : :StrudelToggle (Play / Pause audio)
//   <leader>mu : :StrudelUpdate (UPDATE LIVE PATTERN — Use this constantly!)
//   <leader>ms : :StrudelStop   (Emergency stop audio)
//
// 🎹 NEOVIM DJ MOVES:
//   gcc        : Toggle comment on current line (introduce / mute layer)
//   vip + gc   : Toggle comment on an entire song block
//   vip + d    : Delete the finished song above to clear your screen!
//
// 🚀 THE 3-TRACK JOURNEY:
//   Track 1: "Neon Underground" (Progressive Acid Techno — 126 CPM)
//   Track 2: "Cyberpunk Tokyo"  (Breakbeat Rave & Hyper-Arp — 138 CPM)
//   Track 3: "Stratosphere"     (Euphoric Liquid D&B Finale — 168 CPM)
// =============================================================================


// =============================================================================
